<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - May 1.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - May 1.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Centro Prop	    16.01    2.17</p>
<p> 2   Mt Leyshon Gold	13.16    1.90</p>
<p> 3   Prime Credit Tr	 9.80    1.00</p>
<p> 4   Aust Tour		 9.49    0.79</p>
<p> 5   Natl Consol	     9.18    0.98</p>
<p> 6   Prop Income Inv	 9.17    1.10</p>
<p> 7   BT Prop Trust	   8.97    1.82</p>
<p> 8   Villa World	     8.93    1.12</p>
<p> 9   Equitilink		8.62    0.58</p>
<p>10   Indu Property	   8.58    0.99</p>
<p>11   Gen Prop Tr	     8.55    2.35</p>
<p>12   Countrywide-PP	  8.54    1.19</p>
<p>13   Hills Inds		8.42    2.03</p>
<p>14   Schroder Prop	   8.41    2.20</p>
<p>15   Gandel Retail Tr	8.40    0.93</p>
